* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* Program  N-CP-CHK
* Function codepage support: check for valid codepage via MOVE ENCODED
* Hint     1. ON ERROR used since MOVE ENCODED .. GIVING does not return
*             variable parts of error (:1:)
*          2. MOVE ENCODED used with unicode string to work if CP=OFF
*
* Version  3.5
*
* MAINTENANCE:
* User ID yyyy-mm-dd itrac       Comment
* ------- ---------- ----------- ---------------------------------------
* SU      2017-08-29             NOM 3.5 Created
* fhi     2018-03-24             Add CP from text member in SYSNOMU
*                                ÜÜÜ To be checked by SU ÜÜÜ
************************************************************************
*
DEFINE DATA
PARAMETER
1 CP-NAME   (A) DYNAMIC BY VALUE
1 ERC       (N4) BY VALUE RESULT /*return code: 0=OK, <0=Natural error
1 ERT       (A) DYNAMIC BY VALUE RESULT
************************************************************************
LOCAL
1 #NAT42002
  2 P-DYN-PART     (A253/9)
  2 P-OCCU         (I2)
  2 P-ERROR-NUMBER (I4)
  2 P-RESPONSE     (I4)
1 #A               (A) DYNAMIC
* fhi     2018-03-24            start insertion
1 #CP-NO           (A)    DYNAMIC
1 #CP-DESC         (A)    DYNAMIC
* fhi     2018-03-24            end   insertion
*
END-DEFINE
*
************************************************************************
* Main line
************************************************************************
*
* fhi     2018-03-24            start insertion
CALLNAT 'XXCHCKCP' '#' #CP-NO CP-NAME #CP-DESC ERC
IF ERC = 4 /* Codepage found as a user defined conversion table
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-IF
* fhi     2018-03-24            end   insertion
SET GLOBALS CPCVERR=ON /*SU 2018-03-28
RESET ERC ERT
MOVE ENCODED U'ABC' TO #A CODEPAGE CP-NAME /*GIVING #I4
*
************************************************************************
* End of main line (now subroutines):
************************************************************************
*
* *****
ON ERROR
* *****
  ERC := *ERROR * -1
  CALLNAT 'NAT42002' #NAT42002
  COMPRESS P-DYN-PART (*) TO ERT
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
*
END-ERROR
*
END
